  "details": "If you use an Xbox controller, the bind mapping to control the \"Stream Camera\" is overlapping two different functions.\n\nIf you want to move your own character, sperate from the camera press \"LB\" this works. If you want to move the camera seperate from the character \"Press RB\" this doesn't work, because that button is also bound with changing hand expressions.\n\nI cannot see a way to change keymapping for xbox controllers in the \"Controls\" settings board, so I couldn't fix the issue myself :/",
